  <section class="faq" id="faq-section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
    <div class="head">
      <span class="eyebrow">+ FAQ</span>
      <h2 id="faq-title">
        AI & Voice Assistant <em>FAQs</em>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="list">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <div class="q open">
        <h3>
          <button type="button" id="faq-ai-btn-1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-ai-ans-1">
            What can Salowtech AI Voice and Chat Assistants do for enterprise operations?
            <i class="ic" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="a" id="faq-ai-ans-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-ai-btn-1">
          <div>
            <p>
              Our AI agents answer customer inquiries 24/7 across website chat, WhatsApp, and phone calls. They qualify
              leads, schedule appointments directly into your team's calendar, resolve support tickets, look up order
              statuses in your ERP/CRM, and seamlessly transfer complex calls to human agents.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <div class="q">
        <h3>
          <button type="button" id="faq-ai-btn-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ai-ans-2">
            How human-like is the voice assistant, and what is the latency during phone conversations?
            <i class="ic" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="a" id="faq-ai-ans-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-ai-btn-2">
          <div>
            <p>
              We engineer ultra-low latency voice pipelines (under 500ms response time) using neural speech synthesis
              (TTS) and deep speech recognition (STT). The assistant sounds natural, handles interruptions gracefully,
              understands accents, and pauses naturally like a trained human representative.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <div class="q">
        <h3>
          <button type="button" id="faq-ai-btn-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ai-ans-3">
            How is the AI trained on our company's proprietary products and policies?
            <i class="ic" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="a" id="faq-ai-ans-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-ai-btn-3">
          <div>
            <p>
              We implement Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) connected to your private knowledge base, product
              catalogs, FAQs, and PDFs. The AI provides accurate, hallucination-free answers strictly grounded in your
              company's approved documentation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <div class="q">
        <h3>
          <button type="button" id="faq-ai-btn-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ai-ans-4">
            Does the AI Voice Assistant support multiple languages and regional accents?
            <i class="ic" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="a" id="faq-ai-ans-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-ai-btn-4">
          <div>
            <p>
              Yes. Our voice agents support English, Hindi, Hinglish, Spanish, Arabic, and regional dialects,
              automatically detecting the caller's spoken language and responding in the appropriate tongue and accent.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <div class="q">
        <h3>
          <button type="button" id="faq-ai-btn-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ai-ans-5">
            Can the AI Voice Assistant dial outbound calls for payment reminders or lead qualification?
            <i class="ic" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="a" id="faq-ai-ans-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-ai-btn-5">
          <div>
            <p>
              Yes. The system can execute automated outbound call campaigns for appointment confirmations, abandoned
              cart recovery, event reminders, and subscription renewals with intelligent scheduling and CRM status
              logging.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 6 -->
      <div class="q">
        <h3>
          <button type="button" id="faq-ai-btn-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ai-ans-6">
            How do you prevent data leaks and protect caller confidentiality?
            <i class="ic" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="a" id="faq-ai-ans-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-ai-btn-6">
          <div>
            <p>
              All conversations and transcripts are encrypted in transit and at rest. Personally Identifiable
              Information (PII) is automatically masked or redacted before storage, adhering to strict enterprise
              privacy and telecom compliance standards.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

